# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong with two of its triggers waiting: "Do this only once each turn" limits when the ability
# triggers (CR 603.2h: "This ability triggers only if its source's controller has not yet taken the indicated action that
# turn"), not a trigger already on the stack, and no ruling says otherwise. Bot1 puts the Planetarium out on turn 1 (Sol
# Ring, Black Lotus, Mox Jet). On turn 3 Bot1 draws Consider, activates the Planetarium with Mox Pearl and scries 2
# (Island kept on top, Counterspell to the bottom): the first trigger goes on the stack. In response Bot1 casts Consider
# with the Island: it surveils 1, putting an Island into the graveyard, and draws the next Island, and the Planetarium
# triggers a second time, above the first (CR 701.25d). The second trigger resolves first: Bot1 looks at Misshapen Fiend
# and casts it free. The first trigger, which triggered before anything was cast, then looks at Ornithopter and still
# offers its cast: Bot1 casts it too.

